{"step_index":69,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T12:46:27Z","thinking":"Commencing implementation of the authentication and user modules, focusing initially on authentication. The intention is to define validation schemas, controllers, and routes to handle user authentication workflows. This structured approach aims to establish the foundation for secure user management within the backend.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import { z } from 'zod';\n\nexport const registerSchema = z.object({\n  name: z.string().min(2, 'Name must be at least 2 characters long').max(100),\n  email: z.string().email('Valid email address is required').toLowerCase(),\n  password: z.string().min(6, 'Password must be at least 6 characters long').max(100),\n  role: z.enum(['USER', 'ADMIN', 'CONSULTANT']).optional()\n});\n\nexport const loginSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email('Valid email address is required').toLowerCase(),\n  password: z.string().min(1, 'Password is required')\n});\n","Description":"Create auth Zod validation schemas","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\PRIYANKA\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\career-platform\\backend\\src\\modules\\auth\\auth.validation.ts","toolAction":"Writing backend/src/modules/auth/auth.validation.ts","toolSummary":"Create auth.validation.ts"}}]}
